    "title": "Maps Driving Directions",
    "description": "\ud83d\udd0d Are you looking for current location traffic on maps Driving Directions? \u2934\ufe0f \ud83d\udea6 \ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f \ud83d\ude0d\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Do you need maps driving directions app to get to your desired place without having an internet connection?\ud83d\udcf2\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccc Easily get latitude and longitude of my location and my current location address. Search on my maps to find india map, earth map & village map\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 You can find the distance between two points on the map. Directions home from my location. Share my live location with friends.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0e You can turn on to get navigation online, address for taped location on maps & navigation home.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Driving Directions Finder : Easily get route map of pointed locations. You can find driving directions from the selected location to my location map.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea6 Traffic map finder: Get real time traffic on World Map with different route options, driving directions and route colors.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccd You can find maps, live maps & traffic maps. use maps navigation app to get driving directions, map navigation home on globe & navigation maps.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udeb4 Now it's time to use the best map, navigation home options & shortest route path along with directions.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccc <b> DRIVING DIRECTIONS </b>\r\nGet Driving directions navigation home, current location & live location map. get real time maps directions to my location address on maps and weather updates. \u26c8\ufe0f\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea6 <b> MAPS NAVIGATION </b>\r\nmaps driving directions the most complete app for all you travel enthusiasts. From driving directions, to fastest route finder and live navigation on maps\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0e<b>OFFLINE MAPS</b>\r\nOur maps directions can be downloaded upfront. So get the required maps while you are having an internet connection. With the simplicity to download maps from all over the world, India map and get map directions offline.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0e<b> FIND PLACES NEARBY</b>\r\nWith our nearby places finder, you can explore the best places around you and find bars, restaurants, gas stations, atms, amusement parks, book stores, banks, and more on maps!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0e<b> WEATHER</b>\r\nGet real time weather updates, weather forecast like weather today, Weather tomorrow, weather next week & weather next 15 days.\r\n\r\n\u2934\ufe0f<b> DIRECTIONS </b>\r\nOur maps navigation explore feature allows you to find any place on a map. You can also search places by name and get live navigation home. Our maps navigation app provides multiple navigating features. User can use maps navigation between source and destination points on map. They can view multiple angles, zoom in and out, get directions for driving, bus, walking, bike, and more.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0e<b> Benifits of maps driving directions app:</b>\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Offline maps for countries all around the world\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Intuitive real-time navigation on maps\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Explore the current location\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Live maps show the traffic updates\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Weather forecast, weather updates\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf2<b> Download maps driving directions app now! \ud83d\ude01 \ud83d\ude0d \u270c\ufe0f</b>",
